Part 2 - live CLI demonstration (Done-when boxes 1 and 2)
Merchandising.Maintenance.exe migrate, run as merch_migrator, against a
throwaway migrations folder (outside db/migrations - that stays empty for
P1-07). "merchandising" was confirmed empty before this demo (see
db/migrations/.gitkeep note on the task card) and was reset to empty again
immediately afterward - see Part 3.
====================================================================

--- run 1: first run applies migrations and records them ---
$ dotnet run --project src/Merchandising.Maintenance/Merchandising.Maintenance.vbproj --no-build -- migrate --migrations-dir <tmp>/p1-06-demo-migrations
Applying migrations from '<tmp>/p1-06-demo-migrations' as 'merch_migrator'...
  [OK]   0001_create_demo
  [OK]   0002_seed_demo
exit code: 0

--- run 2: second run applies nothing ---
$ dotnet run --project src/Merchandising.Maintenance/Merchandising.Maintenance.vbproj --no-build -- migrate --migrations-dir <tmp>/p1-06-demo-migrations
